  "notes": "Supervisors now elected BY DISTRICT (new plan approved Jan 27, 2026; all three seats on 2026 ballot; voters vote for only one supervisor candidate — their district). Initial term lengths staggered by lot (District 1: two years per county notice). Candidate list marked FINAL. Township trustee races are vote-for-two; Indian Creek Twp trustee/clerk, New Albany Twp clerk, and Palestine Twp trustee (to fill vacancy) have no printed candidates (write-in only). Sample ballots for all 65 precinct styles checked: no county-level public measures (only Statewide Public Measure 1). Asterisks (incumbent) removed from names."
